    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's just heavy. Knowing that once I make this choice, there's no going back. Like, if I actually do it, is that really the most noble thing a commander can do for his men? To leave them behind like this? Or is it just a way for me to escape the shame? I can't tell anymore if it's strength or just cowardice.",
